            "heading": "When will I receive my tracking number?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p></p><p>Your tracking number will be sent by email once your order ships. You can track your package on our <a href=\"https://serivarm.com/apps/track-order\" title=\"https://serivarm.com/apps/track-order\">Track Order</a> page.</p><p></p>",
